        "• **Differentiation:** The combination of AI mentor, agent playground, and creator tools creates a more distinct offering than Project B’s single-functionality app.",
        "• **Impact & Evidence Plan:** The planned user research and A/B testing show a commitment to validating the product's effectiveness and gathering user feedback.",
        "• **Risk Awareness & Mitigation:** Explicitly identifies and addresses risks like AI integration and UX design, with mitigation strategies outlined."
      ],
      "Cons": [
        "• **Vague Timeline:** The timeline is somewhat loose, relying heavily on ‘proposed’ pilot tests and research, which could lead to delays.",
        "• **Reliance on ‘Proposed’ Research:** The heavy reliance on ‘proposed’ user research and A/B tests introduces uncertainty about the quality and impact of the data gathered.",
        "• **Complexity:** The project’s scope (AI mentor, agent playground, course builder) makes it inherently more complex to execute successfully."
      ]
    },
    "Project B": {
      "Pros": [
        "• **Clear Problem Statement:** The description of the coaching gap is relatable and clearly articulates the need.",
        "• **Simple Value Proposition:** The core concept – AI-powered sprint coaching – is easy to understand.",
        "• **Feasibility & Development Plan:** A relatively straightforward development plan with a defined launch date (albeit with a buffer).",
        "• **Low Fulfillment Risk:** Primarily digital rewards minimize fulfillment challenges.",
        "• **Concise & Focused:** The project is tightly focused on a specific use case (sprint coaching)."
      ],
      "Cons": [
