        "• **Risk Awareness & Mitigation:** The risk assessment is basic and lacks detailed mitigation strategies.",
        "• **Lack of Concrete Evidence:** The claim of ‘patent pending’ lacks supporting details and doesn't demonstrate a competitive advantage."
      ]
    }
  },
  "winner": "A"
}
